<title>CHINA: Fujitsu in China data transmission pact.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu in China data transmission pact.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fujitsu Ltd of Japan has signed an agreement with the city of Hefei in China's eastern province of Anhui to build a digital data transmission network, the Xinhua news agency said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The synchronous digital hierarchy network, with a transmission speed of 2.5 gigabytes per second, would be built by Fujitsu subsidiary Nanjing Fujitsu and the Hefei Posts and Telecommunications Bureau, the agency said.</p>
<p>The project would be completed by the end of 1996, Xinhua said without giving further details.</p>
</text>
